  "metaRegistry": "https://w3id.org/ogc/bblocks/meta-register.json",
  "name": "Building Blocks - RSS-Hydro Model of Models Building Blocks",
  "abstract": "Provenance building blocks for the RSS-Hydro Model of Models (MoM) flood prediction workflow,\nprofiled for the OGC Open Science Persistent Demonstrator (OSPD) 2026.\n",
  "description": "W3C PROV profile and activity vocabulary for a minimal slice of the MoM workflow:\nGFMS per-watershed cell attribution, GFMS per-watershed aggregation, and GloFAS + GFMS\nhazard score accumulation.\n",
  "modified": "2026-10-14T15:14:33.982546",
  "tooling": {
    "bblocks-postprocess": {
      "commitId": "\"f470eb472692ab3e5845074dc94405af89b2f182",
